@startuml UML-RUNTIME-LIFECYCLE
title Runtime Lifecycle
[*] --> Created
Created --> Initializing
Initializing --> Ready : dependencies valid
Initializing --> Failed : startup error
Ready --> Running
Running --> Quiescing : shutdown requested
Quiescing --> Stopping : intake stopped / work checkpointed
Stopping --> Stopped
Failed --> Stopped : resources released
Stopped --> [*]
@enduml
